{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1531543-fireheart-kith-write-up","id":1531543,"title":"Fireheart Kith Write-up","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-26T14:03:28-08:00","id":1531543,"title":"Fireheart Kith Write-up","content":"I know this isn't an impressive write-up but her is my attempt and the Fireheart Kith let me know what you all think.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Firehearts</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Firehearts are close cousins to the Bright Ones but, as they served their keepers served as mere illumination for innumerable inhuman balls, dinners, and hunts; the Firehearts served as the forge and cook fires for their True Fae masters.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Elemental: The air around this changeling ripples and shimmers as though she is on fire. His hair is a blazing orange, almost iridescent. He is quick to anger and slow to forgive once someone has earned his wrath.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Ogre: This absolute mountain of a man looks as though he has coal black skin veined with cracks with a fiery glow. His long hair and beard are the color of a raging inferno burning orange eyes that will stop you dead in your tracks.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Kith Blessing: When the Fireheart uses Intimidation to stare down an opponent with his fiery gaze, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fiery Aura: A Fireheart always a fiery aura radiating from him, though the mask normally prevents mortals from seeing or feeling it. When he successfully grapples someone, a Fireheart may spend a point of Glamour to burn them as if she set them on fire. The Firehearts grapple burns an area on the target the size of a torch (Changeling, p. 191) with the heat of a Bunsen burner, including clothing and other combustible materials. </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}